error[DS0127]: trailing `,` before `)`
  --> query:1:54
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | extend x = strcat(customerId, 'a', ) | sort by amount desc,
  |                                                      ^ nothing follows this `,` in the list
  |
  = help: remove the `,`

error[DS0127]: trailing `,` at the end of the input
  --> query:1:79
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | extend x = strcat(customerId, 'a', ) | sort by amount desc,
  |                                                                               ^ nothing follows this `,` in the list
  |
